                   rdfs:label "Setting di terapia"@it ,
                              "Therapy setting"@en ;
                   skos:definition "The clinical context, timing, or intent of the cancer therapy (e.g., adjuvant, palliative, induction, neoadjuvant)."@en .


###  http://irst.emr.it/cvl/UnknownGender
